type: txt
help: Firewall ruleset containing the target rule
syntax:expression: pattern $VAR(@) "^(forward|input|output|name:[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9_.-]*)$" ; "ruleset must be forward, input, output, or name:<ruleset>"
allowed: echo forward input output
val_help: forward; firewall ipv4 forward filter
val_help: input; firewall ipv4 input filter
val_help: output; firewall ipv4 output filter
val_help: name:<ruleset>; firewall ipv4 name <ruleset> — a zone rule
